  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till &quot;the Macroeconomic and Financial Management Institute of    Eastern and Southern Africa&quot; (MEFMI). MEFMI &#xe4;r ett regionalt institut som syftar till att skapa f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden f&#xf6;r ekonomisk tillv&#xe4;xt genom   att st&#xe4;rka den makroekonomiska och finansiella ledningen via          institutionell och m&#xe4;nsklig kapacitetsbyggnad i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Macroeconomic and Financial Management Institute of    Eastern and Southern Africa (MEFMI). MEFMI is a regionally owned      institute aiming at creating conditions for economic growth by        strengthening macroeconomic and financial management through          institutional and human capacity building in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
